Circular reference detection has been implemented in `parseConfig` using a `visitedKeys` set.

### Implementation Details
```typescript
    const visitedKeys = new Set<string>([key]);
    let currentVal = value;

    while (typeof currentVal === 'string') {
      const targetKey = currentVal in raw
        ? currentVal
        : currentVal.match(/^\$\{([^}]+)\}$/)?.[1];

